    "head_branch": "feature/hp-and-cooldown-in-store",
    "head_commit_message": "feat(tools): tick_phases counts each phase's column copies\n\n`tick_phases copies` swaps the timed battle's native columns for ColumnCopies,\nwhich passes every call on unchanged and files, under the phase that made it,\neach whole-column copy out of the field and into it with the slots it moved,\nand each scattered value and put. Spec 35 step 5b measures the copies #229's\nbenches pointed at before fixing them.\n\nWaived-by: Decision 142\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KKUhViTbS7kfMBSZozDAco",
